      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-d4fb9401aad11a02bbdd35ae",
        "relation": "background",
        "quote": "Behind the struggle and game between China and the United States are four sets of overlapping and mutually causal logics, namely the growth and decline of the two countries’ strength, ideological differences, changes in the international environment, and domestic political influence.",
